      "readme": "# Language Learning Aptitude dataset\n\n## Original paper\nWill be added when accepted for publication. \n\n## Overview \nIn this study, brain structural correlates of LLAMA test scores were explored. \nThe dataset includes T1-weighted, PD-weighted (used to mitigate B1 inhomogeneities and eliminate PD-weighted and T2* effects),\nand two sets of diffusion weighted images (one single-shell with high angular resolution and one multi-shelled). \n\n## Contact\nPlease contact mikael.noven@ling.lu.se for any inquiries regarding this dataset. ",
